<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-RESULTS OF ASIAN CUP MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF ASIAN CUP MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Asian Cup group A</p>
<p>matches played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates 2 Indonesia 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Hassan Ahmed 14, Adnan Al Talyani 65</p>
<p>Attendence: 10,000</p>
<p>South Korea 0 Kuwait 2 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Jassem Al-Houwaidi 60, Bashar Abdulaziz 87</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Group A final standings (tabulate under: played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost goals for, goals against, points)</p>
<p>    UAE	    3   2   1   0   6   3   7</p>
<p>    Kuwait	 3   0   1   1   6   5   4</p>
<p>    South Korea  3   1   1   1   5   5   4</p>
<p>    Indonesia    3   0   1   2   4   8   1</p>
</text>
